          "worked": "France and Spain only: $10-8=2$.\n\nEngland and Spain only: $29-12-2-8=7$.\n\nEngland and France only: $38-13-7-8=10$.\n\nFrance only: $26-10-2-8=6$.\n\n$$\\begin{align*}P(\\text{France only})&=\\frac{6}{58}\\\\&=\\frac{3}{29}\\end{align*}$$",
