          "worked": "Include those who visited all three countries.\n\n$$\\begin{align*}n(\\text{England and France})&=10+8\\\\&=18\\\\P(\\text{England and France})&=\\frac{18}{58}\\\\&=\\frac{9}{29}\\end{align*}$$",
